    "stem": "Priestly criticizes her assistant for her _______.",
    "stemTranslation": null,
    "options": [
      {
        "key": "A",
        "text": "lack of imagination.",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "distractorType": "CONCEPT_DISTORTION",
        "analysis": "断章取义与字面陷阱。原文为 for imagining that high fashion doesn't affect her，imagining 在此是‘以为、自以为’之意，选项偷换概念拼凑成‘缺乏想象力（lack of imagination）’。",
        "vocab": [
          {
            "word": "fashion",
            "ipa": "[ˈfæʃ(ə)n]",
            "meaning": "时尚",
            "level": "green",
            "isSelfAnnotated": false
          }
        ],
        "selfAnnotated": false
      },
      {
        "key": "B",
        "text": "poor bargaining skill.",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "distractorType": "UNFOUNDED",
        "analysis": "无中生有。首段末尾虽提到衣服来自 bargain bin（特价处理区），但这只是说明衣服是通过逐级降价流通后购买的折价商品，从未提及助理个人的讨价还价技能好坏。"
      },
      {
        "key": "C",
        "text": "obsession with high fashion.",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "distractorType": "CONTRADICTION",
        "analysis": "正反混淆。助理认为高级时尚与自己毫不相干（doesn't affect her），是对时尚毫不关心甚至排斥，选项却说其‘对高级时尚痴迷（obsession）’，与文意完全相悖。",
        "vocab": [
          {
            "word": "obsession",
            "ipa": "[əbˈseʃn]",
            "meaning": "痴迷",
            "level": "red",
            "isSelfAnnotated": true
          },
