            "meaning": "时尚",
            "level": "green",
            "isSelfAnnotated": false
          }
        ],
        "selfAnnotated": true
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": "insensitivity to fashion.",
        "isCorrect": true,
        "analysis": "定位至首段 S1：“Priestly ... scolds her unattractive assistant for imagining that high fashion doesn't affect her.” 助理自以为高级时装影响不到自己，因而遭到训斥，说明她对时尚的存在及其无孔不入的影响力麻木不仁、毫无感知，insensitivity to fashion 正是 imagining that high fashion doesn't affect her 的精准同义替换。",
        "vocab": [
          {
            "word": "lack",
            "ipa": "[læk]",
            "meaning": "缺乏",
            "level": "green",
            "isSelfAnnotated": false
          },
          {
            "word": "imagination",
            "ipa": "[ɪˌmædʒɪˈneɪʃ(ə)n]",
            "meaning": "想象力",
            "level": "green",
            "isSelfAnnotated": false
          }
        ],
        "selfAnnotated": false
      }
    ],
    "officialAnswer": "D",
