            "meaning": "防止",
            "level": "red",
            "isSelfAnnotated": true
          }
        ],
        "selfAnnotated": true
      },
      {
        "key": "B",
        "text": "shop for their garments more frequently.",
        "isCorrect": true,
        "analysis": "定位至第二段 S6：“These labels encourage style-conscious consumers to see clothes as disposable ... and to renew their wardrobe every few weeks.” 品牌鼓励消费者将衣服视作一次性用品并每隔数周就更新衣柜，这与‘更加频繁地采购服装（shop for garments more frequently）’构成精准同义改写。",
